abstract: >-
  An open-source, reproducible and bilingual techno-economic model for
  Space-Based Solar Power. It calculates conditional delivered-grid LCOE and
  explores the effects of launch cost, orbital mass, conversion efficiency,
  lifecycle assumptions and finance.
